{% doc %}
  Renders products from one collection in a grid (Figma 1:490): eyebrow, h2
  heading, optional View all link next to the heading or below the grid, and
  up to products_to_show product cards. 2 columns below 48rem, 3 columns from
  48rem (4 when the grid has exactly 4 cards), columns_desktop columns from 80rem.
  No carousel.

  Source: the collection setting; when it is empty, collections[default_collection]
  (the home page template passes 'all' so a fresh install and the CI preview
  show products). When there is no source or it has no products, the editor
  shows placeholder cards with a hint and the storefront renders nothing.

  Variant items (multi-source collections, Editions Fall '26 #20, AC8): an item
  that has a parent `product` is treated as a variant. The card then gets the
  parent product plus `variant: item`, so image, price, ?variant= link and the
  preselected swatch follow that variant. Product items have no `product`
  property and render with the product's default variant.

  Tabs (Figma 1:496, AC-H11, AC-H12): tab 1 is the source above, tabs 2 to 4 come
  from tab_N_collection or collections[default_tab_N_collection]. A tab shows only
  when it has a collection. With fewer than 2 tabs there is no tab bar and the
  output matches a block without tabs. Labels are block settings, so a template
  presets one with tab_N_label; empty label: collection title.

  The first tab's grid is rendered. Other panels hold their grid in a template
  element, so hidden tabs load no images and no JavaScript means no request at all.
  Without JavaScript each tab is a link to its collection. An empty collection
  shows a translated message in its panel.

  JavaScript hooks (assets/collection-tabs.js, BE ES1-T189), only with 2 or more
  tabs: data-collection-tabs (root), custom element collection-tabs (wraps the
  block content), data-lazy-module (on it, URL of assets/collection-tabs.js, read
  by assets/lazy-module.js), data-tab-list (tab row), data-tab="N" (link,
  aria-current on the first one), data-tab-panel="N" (panel, has an id for
  aria-controls, hidden except the first), data-tab-panel-template="N" (template
  in that panel), data-tab-empty (empty message). The active style follows
  aria-selected once set, otherwise aria-current.

  Cards need no JavaScript: swatches are indicators (TE-3 AC2, ADR 0010).
  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  Test hooks: data-testid="featured-collection", "featured-collection-heading",
  "featured-collection-grid", "featured-collection-view-all",
  "featured-collection-placeholder", "featured-collection-tabs",
  "featured-collection-tab", "featured-collection-panel",
  "featured-collection-tab-empty".

  @param {string} [id] - Static block id, so this block keeps its own settings. Also used for the heading id. Default: block.id
  @param {string} [default_collection] - Collection handle used when the collection setting is empty, such as 'all'. Empty: no fallback
  @param {string} [default_tab_2_collection] - Collection handle for tab 2 when its setting is empty. Empty: no fallback
  @param {string} [default_tab_3_collection] - Collection handle for tab 3 when its setting is empty. Empty: no fallback
  @param {string} [default_tab_4_collection] - Collection handle for tab 4 when its setting is empty. Empty: no fallback

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'home-featured-collection', tag: 'div' %}
    {% block 'featured-collection', id: 'featured-collection', default_collection: 'all' %}{% endblock %}
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign source = block.settings.collection
  if source == blank and default_collection != blank
    assign source = collections[default_collection]
  endif

  assign limit = block.settings.products_to_show
  assign columns = block.settings.columns_desktop
  assign eyebrow = block.settings.eyebrow
  assign heading = block.settings.heading
  assign heading_id = id | default: block.id | append: '-heading'
  assign panel_id_prefix = id | default: block.id | append: '-panel-'
  assign image_sizes = '(min-width: 1280px) calc(1416px / ' | append: columns | append: '), (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw'

  assign tab_count = 0
  assign first_source = nil
  assign first_body = ''
  assign tab_links = ''
  assign hidden_panels = ''
-%}

{%- for tab_number in (1..4) -%}
  {%- liquid
    case tab_number
      when 1
        assign tab_source = source
        assign tab_label = block.settings.tab_1_label
      when 2
        assign tab_source = block.settings.tab_2_collection
        if tab_source == blank and default_tab_2_collection != blank
          assign tab_source = collections[default_tab_2_collection]
        endif
        assign tab_label = block.settings.tab_2_label
      when 3
        assign tab_source = block.settings.tab_3_collection
        if tab_source == blank and default_tab_3_collection != blank
          assign tab_source = collections[default_tab_3_collection]
        endif
        assign tab_label = block.settings.tab_3_label
      when 4
        assign tab_source = block.settings.tab_4_collection
        if tab_source == blank and default_tab_4_collection != blank
          assign tab_source = collections[default_tab_4_collection]
        endif
        assign tab_label = block.settings.tab_4_label
    endcase

    if tab_source.handle == blank
      continue
    endif

    assign tab_count = tab_count | plus: 1
  -%}

  {%- capture tab_body -%}
    {%- if tab_source.products_count > 0 -%}
      <ul class="featured-collection__grid" role="list" data-testid="featured-collection-grid">
        {%- for item in tab_source.products limit: limit -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign card_product = item
            assign card_variant = nil
            if item.product != blank
              assign card_product = item.product
              assign card_variant = item
            endif
          -%}
          <li class="featured-collection__item">
            {% render 'product-card',
              product: card_product,
              variant: card_variant,
              sizes: image_sizes,
              loading: 'lazy'
            %}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="featured-collection__empty" data-tab-empty data-testid="featured-collection-tab-empty">
        {{- 'blocks.featured_collection.tab_empty' | t -}}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- capture tab_links -%}
    {{- tab_links -}}
    <a
      class="featured-collection__tab"
      href="{{ tab_source.url }}"
      {% if tab_count == 1 %}
        aria-current="true"
      {% endif %}
      data-tab="{{ tab_count }}"
      data-testid="featured-collection-tab"
    >
      {{- tab_label | default: tab_source.title | escape -}}
    </a>
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- if tab_count == 1 -%}
    {%- assign first_source = tab_source -%}
    {%- assign first_body = tab_body -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- capture hidden_panels -%}
      {{- hidden_panels -}}
      <div
        class="featured-collection__panel"
        id="{{ panel_id_prefix }}{{ tab_count }}"
        hidden
        data-tab-panel="{{ tab_count }}"
        data-testid="featured-collection-panel"
      >
        <template data-tab-panel-template="{{ tab_count }}">
          {{- tab_body -}}
        </template>
      </div>
    {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- liquid
  assign source = first_source

  assign has_products = false
  if source != blank and source.products_count > 0
    assign has_products = true
  endif

  assign show_view_all = false
  if has_products and block.settings.show_view_all
    assign show_view_all = true
  endif
  assign view_all_in_header = false
  if show_view_all and block.settings.view_all_position == 'header'
    assign view_all_in_header = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if show_view_all -%}
  {%- assign collection_title = source.title | escape -%}
  {%- capture view_all_link -%}
    <a class="button button--secondary featured-collection__view-all" href="{{ source.url }}" data-testid="featured-collection-view-all">
      {{- 'blocks.featured_collection.view_all' | t -}}
      <span class="visually-hidden"> {{ 'blocks.featured_collection.view_all_suffix' | t: collection: collection_title }}</span>
    </a>
  {%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- capture block_body -%}
    {%- if tab_count > 1 or eyebrow != blank or heading != blank or view_all_in_header -%}
      <div class="featured-collection__header{% if tab_count > 1 %} featured-collection__header--tabs{% endif %}">
        {%- if eyebrow != blank or heading != blank -%}
          <div class="featured-collection__titles">
            {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}
              <p class="featured-collection__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="featured-collection__heading" id="{{ heading_id }}" data-testid="featured-collection-heading">
                {{- heading -}}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if tab_count > 1 -%}
          <div
            class="featured-collection__tabs"
            role="group"
            aria-label="{{ 'blocks.featured_collection.tabs_label' | t }}"
            data-tab-list
            data-testid="featured-collection-tabs"
          >
            {{- tab_links -}}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if view_all_in_header -%}
          {{ view_all_link }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if tab_count > 1 -%}
      <div
        class="featured-collection__panel"
        id="{{ panel_id_prefix }}1"
        data-tab-panel="1"
        data-testid="featured-collection-panel"
      >
        {{- first_body -}}
      </div>
      {{- hidden_panels -}}
    {%- elsif has_products -%}
      {{- first_body -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="featured-collection__placeholder" data-testid="featured-collection-placeholder">
        <p class="featured-collection__hint">{{ 'blocks.featured_collection.placeholder' | t }}</p>
        <ul class="featured-collection__grid" role="list" data-testid="featured-collection-grid">
          {%- for i in (1..limit) -%}
            {%- assign placeholder_index = forloop.index0 | modulo: 6 | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- assign placeholder_name = 'product-' | append: placeholder_index -%}
            <li class="featured-collection__item">
              <span class="featured-collection__placeholder-media">
                {{- placeholder_name | placeholder_svg_tag: 'featured-collection__placeholder-svg' -}}
              </span>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_view_all and view_all_in_header == false -%}
      <div class="featured-collection__footer">
        {{ view_all_link }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if has_products or request.design_mode or tab_count > 1 -%}
  <section
    class="featured-collection"
    style="--columns: {{ columns }};"
    {% if heading != blank %}
      aria-labelledby="{{ heading_id }}"
    {% endif %}
    {% if tab_count > 1 %}
      data-collection-tabs
    {% endif %}
    data-testid="featured-collection"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if tab_count > 1 -%}
      <collection-tabs data-lazy-module="{{ 'collection-tabs.js' | asset_url }}">
        {{- block_body -}}
        <script src="{{ 'lazy-module.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
      </collection-tabs>
    {%- else -%}
      {{- block_body -}}
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.featured_collection",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "t:labels.collection",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.products_to_show",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_desktop",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 5,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.columns_desktop",
      "info": "t:info.columns_desktop",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:labels.eyebrow",
      "default": "Bestsellers"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "What People Are Buying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_view_all",
      "label": "t:labels.show_view_all",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "view_all_position",
      "label": "t:labels.view_all_position",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "header",
          "label": "t:options.view_all_position.header"
        },
        {
          "value": "bottom",
          "label": "t:options.view_all_position.bottom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_1_label",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_1_label",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_label",
      "default": "All"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "tab_2_collection",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_2_collection",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_2_label",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_2_label",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_label",
      "default": "Weight"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "tab_3_collection",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_3_collection",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_3_label",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_3_label",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_label",
      "default": "Portable Fitness"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "tab_4_collection",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_4_collection",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_4_label",
      "label": "t:labels.featured_collection_tab_4_label",
      "info": "t:info.featured_collection_tab_label",
      "default": "Accessories"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
